":null,"translatedLanguage":"en","externalUrl":null,"isUnavailable":false,"publishAt":"2022-01-10T11:39:56+00:00","readableAt":"2022-01-10T11:39:56+00:00","createdAt":"2022-01-10T11:39:56+00:00","updatedAt":"2022-03-05T18:05:42+00:00","version":6,"pages":25},"relationships":[{"id":"3c162e89-7eab-401c-9a8c-409824e5796b","type":"scanlation_group","attributes":{"name":"Knights of Earl Grey","altNames":[],"locked":false,"website":null,"ircServer":null,"ircChannel":null,"discord":"p5kdYP7","contactEmail":null,"description":"*A group of cavalier chevaliers dedicated to serving you manga and manhua of the isekai shoujo & fantasy variety!*  \r\n**Currently Recruiting:**  \r\nCleaners/Redrawers  \r\nTypesetters","twitter":null,"mangaUpdates":null,"focusedLanguages":["en"],"official":false,"verified":false,"inactive":true,"publishDelay":null,"exLicensed":false,"createdAt":"2021-04-19T21:45:59+00:00","updatedAt":"2023-11-30T14:42:56+00:00","version":2}},{"id":"878634d2-ea39-4001-a4bf-31458020d16a","type":"manga"},{"id":"ac19dd0e-8b91-49f3-b751-8642fd4be543","type":"user"}]},{"id":"b23c2890-2b86-40d5-83d3-c95db9974e81","type":"chapter","attributes":{"volume":"3","chapter":"13.1","title":null,"translatedLanguage":"en","externalUrl":null,"isUnavailable":false,"publishAt":"2022-03-04T01:25:10+00:00","readableAt":"2022-03-04T01:25:10+00:00","createdAt":"2022-03-04T01:25:09+00:00","updatedAt":"2022-04-27T16:47:22+00:00","version":5,"pages":15},"relationships":[{"id":"147b634b-5b9c-475a-bd7f-39d83ca8fa32","type":"scanlation_group","attributes":{"name":"Lubuntu Bionic Beaver Scans","altNames":[],"locked":false,"website":"https://stukas.henai.eu","ircServer":null,"ircChannel":null,"discord":"ApJPbDrec3","contactEmail":"ninefreaks@yandex.com","description":"The name comes from the German air force plains from the second world war, called \"Junkers Ju 87\", schort \"Stuka\". (This is not the case anymore since we now are \"Lubuntu Bionic Beaver Scans\" and not \"Stukas\" anymore)\n\nBy the way, we are recruiting! Check out the positions:\n<https://stukas.henai.eu/recruitement/>\n  \n(Basically I won't pick up any (big) series, when I translated a chapter or two, I probably will discontinue them because other groups may be translating them and I just Scanlate because i'm bored(?). )\n  \nSeries I picked up because I finally got some more staff:  \n- When I Was Reincarnated in Another World, I Was a Heroine and He Was a Hero [[Link]](https://mangadex.org/title/49634/)  -- IN WORK\n- Guild no Cheat na Uketsukejou [[Link]](https://mangadex.org/title/7a3b7dfd-4ea6-4021-9e6a-130e6ecf3640) -- SOON\n- ILY [[link]](https://mangadex.org/title/62316/ily)  -- Nevermind\n  \nSeries I don't pick up but have a Chapter released:  \n- Yoku Wakaranai keredo Isekai ni Tensei Shiteita You Desu [[Link]](https://mangadex.org/title/42868/i-don-t-really-get-it-but-it-looks-like-i-was-reincarnated-in-another-world)  \n- Villainess Level 99 ~I May Be the Hidden Boss but I'm Not the Demon Lord~ [[Link]](https://mangadex.org/title/878634d2-ea39-4001-a4bf-31458020d16a/villainess-level-99-i-may-be-the-hidden-boss-but-i-m-not-the-demon-lord) -- Other group working on it\n  \nSeries I used to color but dropped:\n- The Boy Who Awakened a New Fetish (Fan-Coloured) [[Link]](https://mangadex.org/title/62232/the-boy-who-awakened-a-new-fetish-fan-coloured)  \n  \nHere is my Blog, website and release-tracker:\n<https://stukas.henai.eu>  \nAlso make sure to join the Discord:\n<https://discord.gg/ApJPbDrec3>\n\nI love you all <3","twitter":"https://twitter.com/saintly2k","mangaUpdates":null,"focusedLanguages":["en"],"official":false,"verified":false,"inactive":false,"publishDelay":null,"exLicensed":false,"createdAt":"2021-04-19T21:45:59+00:00","updatedAt":"2022-10-11T21:50:21+00:00","version":5}},{"id":"9e25d59a-b27b-407d-84be-c139e53538f8","type":"scanlation_group","attributes":{"name":"weltenWanderer Scans","altNames":[],"locked":false,"website":"https://wws.h33t.moe","ircServer":null,"ircChannel":null,"discord":"gFux2eazGp","contactEmail":"ninefreaks@yandex.com","description":"Update 2024-05-14: Ich werde nun alte Projekte fortsetzen... unregelmäßig. Bis dann!\n\nNun ja, nach fast zwei Jahren scanlation ist es nun so weit und ich muss das hier schweren Herzens schreiben. Die Gruppe ist so gut wie tot und ich, saintly1337, bin mit meiner Schwester, ein_asutronaut_werden, und meinem Freunde, s-vhs, die letzten Mitglieder dieser einst so schönen Gruppe.\n\nAb und zu werden Releases kommen, jedoch werden keine großen Serien mehr in Arbeit kommen, solange nicht doch noch jemand da ist, der aktiv lust auf deutsche Scanlations hat.\n\nIch und der Rest der Gruppe, die zumindest noch aktiv sind, werden uns nun der englischen Scanlation widmen. Unsere Werke werden wir unter der Gruppe [Lubuntu Bionic Beaver Scans](https://mangadex.org/group/147b634b-5b9c-475a-bd7f-39d83ca8fa32/lubuntu-bionic-beaver-scans) auf MangaDex und [Asuna](https://manga.asuna.cloud) hochladen.\n\nDanke für diese wundervolle Zeit mit allen von euch, ehemaligen Mitgliedern und Lesern. Durch Scanlations habe ich auch viele neue Freunde gefunden und Spaß an etwas.\n\nDanke an:\n- Meshre, ein guter Freund der am Anfange dabei war,\n- Quakl für ein Kapitel typesetting,\n- Plagues fürs bewerben,\n- ekko331 fürs typesetten,\n- Artemi fürs übersetzen und proofreaden,\n- kIRA fürs cleanen und redrawen,\n- EVE fürs übersetzen und\n- Kripo fürs proofreaden.\n\nBesonderen Dank an Auvrandill, der mir die Kunst des scanlierens beigebracht hat und mir somit meine Freude am scanlieren gezeigt hat.\n\nDanke für alles.\n\nP.S: Der Discord-Server ist noch online. Die Webseite habe ich inzwischen offline genommen. Ich weiß nicht, ob ich die jemals wieder online holen werde, solange diese Gruppe halbtot ist.","twitter":"https://twitter.com/saintly2k","mangaUpdates":null,"focusedLanguages":["de","en"],"official":false,"verified":false,"inactive":false,"publishDelay":null,"exLicensed":false,"createdAt":"20